OL,5,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FDerbyshire's Road Crime Team hunt
OL,7,     Fdown organised crime gangs
OL,8,     Fstealing cars. Following a spike
OL,9,     Fin car thefts, officers are on the
OL,10,     Flookout for cross-border gangs
OL,11,     Fstealing high end cars.
OL,12,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FMore than 60 thefts are reported
OL,14,     Fto Derbyshire Police every day. In
OL,15,     Fthis episode, following a rise in
OL,16,     Fthefts across the East Midlands,
OL,17,     Fofficers target organised gangs of
OL,18,     Fthieves.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/8
