OL,5,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThis episode opens with the hunt
OL,7,     Ffor three teens alleged to have
OL,8,     Fthreatened a shopkeeper with a
OL,9,     Fgun. The firearms team flood the
OL,10,     Farea.
OL,11,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FOn a stormy night, the
OL,13,     FInterceptors get on the tail of a
OL,14,     Ffast-moving Astra that's been
OL,15,     Freported stolen. The desperate
OL,16,     Fdriver twice evades the jaws of
OL,17,     FPaul and Lewis's stinger.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/8
