OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FTane finds inspiration in an
OL,7,     Funlikely place. Eden calls on
OL,8,     FRemi. Alf keeps Marilyn in the
OL,9,     Fdark.
OL,10,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,11,     FA student waiting to see if his
OL,12,     FA-level results will allow him to
OL,13,     Fstudy medicine at university is
OL,14,     Fsent to hosptial for tests on a
OL,15,     Fstomach complaint.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FChristine, 71, has a bleeding head
OL,18,     Ffollowing a fall. As she is on
OL,19,     Fblood thinners, a scan is urgently
OL,20,     Fneeded. Dean has necrotising
OL,21,     Ffasciitis, a flesh-eating
OL,22,     Finfection.
