OL,12,     FA knife fight leads to a suspect
OL,13,     Fheadbutting a windscreen, there's
OL,14,     Fa suspected terrorist bomb at a
OL,15,     Fshopping centre, and a car
OL,16,     Fcolliding with a telegraph pole
OL,17,     Fbrings down a live wire.
